<title>USA: Crane Co acquires Arizona wholesaler.</title>
<headline>Crane Co acquires Arizona wholesaler.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial products manufacturer Crane Co said on Tuesday it acquired privately held MALLCO Lumber &amp; Building Materials Inc, an Arizona wholesale distributor of lumber, doors and engineered wood products, in a cash transaction.</p>
<p>Crane did not disclose a purchase price, but said MALLCO had sales of roughly $70 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Crane said MALLCO would be integrated with the existing millwork and lumber distribution businesses of its Huttig Sash &amp; Door unit.</p>
</text>
